<title>NEW ZEALAND: FORECAST-Consensus of NZ employment, retail data.</title>
<headline>FORECAST-Consensus of NZ employment, retail data.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-11-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following is a table of economists' forecasts for the following data due during November from Statistics New Zealand:</p>
<p>September quarter Household Labour Force Survey (Nov 8), August Quarterly Employment Survey (Nov 19), September quarter Labour Cost Index (Nov 22) and September Retail Trade (Nov 15).</p>
<p>Note - Averages are rounded.</p>
<p>----------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>SEPT QUARTER HOUSEHOLD LABOUR FORCE SURVEY (s/adj, percent)</p>
<p>		   Unemployment   Qtrly	 Yrly     Participation</p>
<p>			 rate     employment  employment	rate</p>
<p>					growth	growth</p>
<p>----------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>    AMP		6.2	  -0.2	  2.4	     66.0</p>
<p>    ANZ		6.1	   0.3	  2.9	     65.3</p>
<p>    ASB		6.1	   0.2	  2.9	     65.7</p>
<p>    BAIN	     6.5	   0.4	  3.0	     66.1</p>
<p>    BANCORP	  6.2	   0.4	  2.9	     65.6</p>
<p>    BNZ		6.2	   0.2	  2.8	     65.8</p>
<p>    BT		 6.4	   0.0	  2.6	     66.0</p>
<p>    DOYLE	    6.1	   0.4	  3.0	     65.9</p>
<p>    WARBURG	  6.3	   0.1	  2.7	     65.8</p>
<p>    WESTPAC	  6.2	   0.3	  2.9	     65.8</p>
<p>---------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>    AVERAGE	 6.23	  0.21	 2.81	     65.8</p>
